ve\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(B) & =-det(A) \\\\  & =-(-31) \\\\  & =31.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-edd46d74-f62c-517b-8453-8f9197d0ad86"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-edd46d74-f62c-517b-8453-8f9197d0ad86" :answer-field/id #uuid "edd46d74-f62c-517b-8453-8f9197d0ad86" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-c5443e90-7aee-5bc1-a30a-b2f9ff32c2b9" :answer-field/choices ["answer-80e46785-3f40-5bfb-b506-ee8a0c415aa0" "answer-b4c18730-0551-5ec0-ac45-4897f2ad6861" "answer-dcfe2730-e5ca-5dd2-b8bf-510e57549d6c" "answer-c5443e90-7aee-5bc1-a30a-b2f9ff32c2b9" "answer-c3c47c2f-883c-5037-ae79-eec8f1f5feb7"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-80e46785-3f40-5bfb-b506-ee8a0c415aa0" :answer/id #uuid "80e46785-3f40-5bfb-b506-ee8a0c415aa0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-31" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b4c18730-0551-5ec0-ac45-4897f2ad6861" :answer/id #uuid "b4c18730-0551-5ec0-ac45-4897f2ad6861" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-dcfe2730-e5ca-5dd2-b8bf-510e57549d6c" :answer/id #uuid "dcfe2730-e5ca-5dd2-b8bf-510e57549d6c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "21" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c5443e90-7aee-5bc1-a30a-b2f9ff32c2b9" :answer/id #uuid "c5443e90-7aee-5bc1-a30a-b2f9ff32c2b9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "31" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c3c47c2f-883c-5037-ae79-eec8f1f5feb7" :answer/id #uuid "c3c47c2f-883c-5037-ae79-eec8f1f5feb7" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Undefined" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-9e7ff967-4362-5d3c-a258-c6d91f60d8e0" :question/id #uuid "9e7ff967-4362-5d3c-a258-c6d91f60d8e0" :question/math-academy-id "q-130685" :question/problem "Suppose $B$ is a $7\\times 7$ matrix and $det(B)=103.$ The matrix $C$ is obtained from $B$ by applying the elementary row operation ${R}_{7}↔{R}_{3}$ (switching the seventh and the third rows). What is the value of $det(C)?$" :question/worked-solution "Since swapping any two rows changes the sign of the determinant to the opposite sign, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(C) & =-det(B) \\\\  & =-(103) \\\\  & =-103.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-6a9f68ad-92fa-5436-8d0c-8ac0948686e5"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-6a9f68ad-92fa-5436-8d0c-8ac0948686e5" :answer-field/id #uuid "6a9f68ad-92fa-5436-8d0c-8ac0948686e5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-a73f5def-1f48-510b-8531-86b21e5603ca" :answer-field/choices ["answer-a73f5def-1f48-510b-8531-86b21e5603ca" "answer-870e5925-34c8-51ae-b42b-4ea1fe5d0ca4" "answer-159fb8ce-d84b-5877-8981-51153df872c1" "answer-faac8cd2-8f8b-566d-bf90-337a0a3e3080" "answer-435012c4-9e86-5b0b-bd8c-bfd07580cbd8"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a73f5def-1f48-510b-8531-86b21e5603ca" :answer/id #uuid "a73f5def-1f48-510b-8531-86b21e5603ca" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-103" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-870e5925-34c8-51ae-b42b-4ea1fe5d0ca4" :answer/id #uuid "870e5925-34c8-51ae-b42b-4ea1fe5d0ca4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-73" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-159fb8ce-d84b-5877-8981-51153df872c1" :answer/id #uuid "159fb8ce-d84b-5877-8981-51153df872c1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-faac8cd2-8f8b-566d-bf90-337a0a3e3080" :answer/id #uuid "faac8cd2-8f8b-566d-bf90-337a0a3e3080" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "103" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-435012c4-9e86-5b0b-bd8c-bfd07580cbd8" :answer/id #uuid "435012c4-9e86-5b0b-bd8c-bfd07580cbd8" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Undefined" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-cbb370be-de14-5258-93fd-4e6a870c68bc" :question/id #uuid "cbb370be-de14-5258-93fd-4e6a870c68bc" :question/math-academy-id "q-72730" :question/problem "Suppose $C$ is a $9\\times 9$ matrix and $det(C)=-46.$ The matrix $D$ is obtained from $C$ by applying the elementary row operation ${R}_{9}:=-\\frac{2}{23}{R}_{9}.$ What is the value of $det(D)?$" :question/worked-solution "The row operation applied to $C$ consists of multiplying a row by the number $-\\frac{2}{23}.$\n\nWhen we do this, the determinant is multiplied by the same number. So, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(D) & =-\\frac{2}{23}det(C) \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{23}\\cdot (-46) \\\\  & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-4855b467-0ef4-5a45-8117-ca5224a219c5"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-4855b467-0ef4-5a45-8117-ca5224a219c5" :answer-field/id #uuid "4855b467-0ef4-5a45-8117-ca5224a219c5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-f544947c-0c5e-5671-b370-2a270f2e40fa" :answer-field/choices ["answer-01085bc4-2d6b-556c-908d-a086f143e25f" "answer-bbb4c07b-c598-5d80-b49b-bf9f83404327" "answer-54a05767-12a7-5d4d-811a-9a9690b4fe5e" "answer-354ead57-b818-5300-af89-ce4e85f781ca" "answer-f544947c-0c5e-5671-b370-2a270f2e40fa"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-01085bc4-2d6b-556c-908d-a086f143e25f" :answer/id #uuid "01085bc4-2d6b-556c-908d-a086f143e25f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-bbb4c07b-c598-5d80-b49b-bf9f83404327" :answer/id #uuid "bbb4c07b-c598-5d80-b49b-bf9f83404327" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-54a05767-12a7-5d4d-811a-9a9690b4fe5e" :answer/id #uuid "54a05767-12a7-5d4d-811a-9a9690b4fe5e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :